{"pageId":"b16c9d18-7bac-4c30-9315-9c65e52616cc","pageCanonId":"247d635f-924c-4e83-8383-94965fe769e2","title":"静态（Static）","slug":"static","headerTitle":"静态配色方案","description":"静态配色方案非常适合需要保持一致、统一设计的品牌化产品","headerAlignment":"LEFT","isDescriptionVisible":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T05:32:35.739Z","headerImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmroe3iwo-Color.png?alt=media&token=aefca9e0-3c39-4f5e-a9d3-cfa72d9fdbea","sections":[{"pageSectionId":"e48aa166-2093-4873-a016-98477e1c3b67","pageSectionCanonId":"17452dce-4177-421e-95cd-2b37ba113fa4","name":"基线","position":0,"pageId":"589c6d17-3ef6-475d-8d28-dcd4b443d617","pageCanonId":"247d635f-924c-4e83-8383-94965fe769e2","isVisible":true,"contentBlocks":[{"pageContentBlockId":"0293d95c-99d1-42a5-a60b-9cfa1382c8f5","pageContentBlockCanonId":"527787ec-6bde-42f1-a7a4-a2b6ab548c9d","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"e18b0c9f-6ff7-42c8-bb93-078bfba6292a","pageSectionCanonId":"17452dce-4177-421e-95cd-2b37ba113fa4","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"37267eed-7641-4ffd-aa63-60982e14b913","pageContentChunkCanonId":"d0cc76ec-f701-4065-a98c-3059fa528175","htmlValue":"<p><strong>基线（Baseline）</strong>是默认的静态配色方案。它采用无障碍的颜色配对，并包含浅色与深色主题的颜色。</p><p><strong>使用基线配色方案时，最终用户会看到</strong></p><ul><li>采用静态颜色的无障碍界面 </li></ul>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-02-11T21:53:46.559Z"}]},{"p